# Intelligence & Personalization API rewrites
# In dev, Vite proxies /api/intelligence/* and /api/personalizer/* to the
# Netlify CLI functions server on :8888. In production, Netlify serves
# the functions at /.netlify/functions/* — these rewrites map the
# /api/* paths to the function URLs so the frontend code works in both.

/api/intelligence/*  /.netlify/functions/intelligence-api/:splat  200
/api/personalizer/*   /.netlify/functions/personalizer-api/:splat   200
